@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11
|Sales Employee|
start
:Search product by name or article number;
|System|
:Search product;
if (Product found?) then ([yes])
  :Calculate available stock as physical stock minus active reservations;
  :Show physical, reserved and available stock;
  |Sales Employee|
  :Enter requested quantity;
  |System|
  if (Requested quantity > available stock?) then ([yes])
    :Report insufficient stock to sales employee;
    stop
  else ([no])
    :Confirm quantity is available;
    stop
  endif
else ([no])
  :Show product not found;
  stop
endif
@enduml
